flowchart TB
    GitHub[GitHub source and Actions] --> Build[Build, sign, generate metadata]
    Build --> Server[Patch and release server]
    Server --> Metadata[Signed metadata]
    Server --> APK[Full APK]
    Server --> Delta[Delta patches]
    App[Installed PHNX] --> Checker[UpdateManager and checker]
    Checker --> Metadata
    Checker --> Download[DownloadManager]
    Download --> Verify[VerificationEngine]
    Verify --> Patch[Patch / install engine]
    Patch --> Restart[Restart and startup validation]
    Restart --> Updated[Updated PHNX]

